  "published": "2026-02-02T23:21:33.257Z",
  "releaseNotes": "- Breaking change: removed all lineWeight parameter from all methods in interface WW.Cad.Model.IPathDrawer.\n- Breaking change: removed isPlot parameter from all WW.Cad.Drawing.Wireframe.DrawableUtil methods.\n- Bug fix: fixed foreground color rendering didn't work for text entities for the WW.Cad.Drawing.Wireframe rendering pipeline.\n- Bug fix: PdfExporter/SvgExporter implementation of WW.Cad.Drawing.Wireframe.IDrawer2D didn't set the correct line width for SHX text.\n- Bug fix: multi-platform text rendering crashed for some fonts.\n- Updated PDF and SVG export examples.",
